SHub Stealer is a sophisticated macOS-based Information Stealer and Remote Access Trojan (RAT). It utilizes a combination of AppleScript, Bash scripts, and social engineering ("ClickFix" technique) to harvest sensitive user data and maintain persistent access to the victim's machine.

